ight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{1}{e}^{-t}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on that line. \n\nSince ${e}^{-t}\\to $ \n{{field-4}}\nas $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach \n{{field-5}} \nas $t\\to \\infty .$\n\nLet's add the solutions to the phase space.\n\n![](images/f1/f1335e5420fe6e475cded1092e9b1ba621e0d88f46110b69ffef5e35ed080d6e.png)\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny={{field-6}}\n$$\n\nand the straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{2}{e}^{2t}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on that line.\n\nSince ${e}^{2t}\\to $ \n{{field-7}}\nas $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach \n{{field-8}} \nas $t\\to \\infty .$\n\nLet's add the solutions to the phase space. \n\n![](images/a5/a53bb4e6cd7552b92424b168d0cda90fa1085b5e72fbf8a3c37a3a948bdcf9ad.png)\n\nThe {{field-9}}  of our system looks as follows:\n\n![](images/ec/ecccffb89d43b8de4ce0952d9b8d9686e74670b4d86b29687c76355b70a6ac7d.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186308394 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{v}_{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306223} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{v}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306958}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{v}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306958} :answer-field/key "field-10" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307559} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\infty " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305660} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "infinity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306257} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306569} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\infty " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306656} {