a994659fb7a091692b23bafb3012a705e964419fb71e8aa.png)\n\nFinally, since the dominant eigenvalue is \n{{field-9}},\nsolutions become parallel to the straight-line solution containing the vector\n{{field-10}} \nas they move away from the origin.\n\nThe phase portrait of our system looks as follows:\n\n![](images/7a/7a87773278ef8c921a9e7002a376bac1de99e969c2eb10e4a6f104a854094469.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186422154 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{-3t}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422033} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{3t}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422054} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{-2t}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422081} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{2t}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422112}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{-3t}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422033} :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422120} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "infinity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422039} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "the origin" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422045}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "the origin" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422045} :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422121} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "infinity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422053} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "the origin" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422111}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "infinity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422053} :answer-field/key "field-8" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :ans